# Local Claude Code state. Note that a repo-level .claude/launch.json is inert:
# preview_start only resolves C:\Git_Repos\.claude\launch.json, so site entries
# belong in that root file instead.
.claude/

# Source newsletters. NEVER COMMIT THESE.
#
# This repository is public. The printed Torch carries a page of member
# birthdays and anniversaries: roughly two dozen full names with dates. A PDF
# committed here is as public as one posted on the website, and git keeps it in
# the history even after a later delete. Issue PDFs belong in the R2 bucket,
# uploaded through the admin page, where they stay private by default.
*.pdf

